" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,446][1020,702]" /><node index="1" text="理解重点" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.xuhuangbin.xinghuozhaidu" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,813][228,885]" /><node index="2" text="这不是对胜利日期的精确预言。紧邻的原文明确说，未来只能判断大的方向，不能机械规定时日。信心来自对形势和发展条件的分析，而不是把愿望当作事实。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.xuhuangbin.xinghuozhaidu" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,909][1020,1209]" /><node index="3" text="现实启示" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.xuhuangbin.xinghuozhaidu" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1320][228,1392]" /><node index="4" text="判断一件长期工作有没有前景，既不要被暂时挫折吓住，也不要只凭热情乐观。应寻找正在形成的条件和可验证的早期信号，同时给不确定性留下位置。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.xuhuangbin.xinghuozhaidu" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,1416][1020,1716]" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>